{
  "name": "dsh-startup-moss2",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "rights": "代码 MIT；内嵌 Wallpaper Engine 工坊素材与用户自制音效版权归原权利人，按作者决定随仓库公开分享（非商业个人同人用途，见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md）。",
  "description": "MOSS 550W · 流浪地球 — DSH 启动动画 + UI 皮肤（v0.5 动态地球+柔化交接+机械臂实录音效）：神经接口开幕 → MOSS 苏醒（红色准心锁定特效）→ 一半 MOSS/一半流浪地球转场 → 地球动态视频背景 + 深空玻璃驾驶舱；程序化 BGM/音效、品牌红眼与输入卡角括号呼吸、启动进度条与百分比同步。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "startup",
    "splash",
    "boot-animation",
    "moss",
    "550w",
    "the-wandering-earth",
    "skin",
    "glass",
    "video-background"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "preview",
    "locale",
    "test",
    "docs/*.md",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "INSTALL.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke-host.mjs && node test/smoke-assets.mjs && node test/smoke-splash.mjs && node test/smoke-client.mjs && node test/smoke-css-regress.mjs",
    "pack": "npm pack --pack-destination releases"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "沈宏宏 (QIFANAI)",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/QIFANAI/dsh-startup-moss2.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/QIFANAI/dsh-startup-moss2",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/QIFANAI/dsh-startup-moss2/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ]
    }
  }
}
